  "description": "Our universal quick-attach mounting plate is made of 3/8” thick 50-grade structural steel, so there is no need to worry about bending or corrosion when using it.\nFitment\nUniversal Skid Steer Adapter Plate fits various loaders, tractors, Bobcats, and other vehicles with up to 44’’ interior width.\nFor your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFeatures\nSturdy Steel & Anti-Rust.\nYITAMOTOR Skid Steer Adapter Plate is made from grade 50 heavy-duty steel that’s highly sturdy with 3000 lbs pulling capacity; the Surface is powder coated and painted to withstand rust and harsh environments to extend the lifespan.\nQuick Attach & Easy Mount.\n3/8\" thick Quick Attach Skid Steer Mount Plate attaches effortlessly to your Quick Attach Mounting System; Newly designed with a standard 2’’ trailer receiver that is removable to fit your needs.\nExtensive Compatibility.\nThis Universal Skid Steer Adapter Plate fits various loaders, tractors, Bobcats, and other vehicles with up to 44’’ interior width; The ideal tool to facilitate cumbersome farm and factory work, such as carrying loads, removing snow, etc.\nVarious Applications.\nThis Skid Steer Base Plate can work with a load of heavy-duty equipment; Simply weld or bolt to convert to a quick tach hookup can be used for buckets, snowplows, tractors, trailers, forks, etc.; Features a solderable surface for easy mounting.",
